// Plush Clay: the Plush look in Light.
// One warm sand surface everywhere; panes are soft raised cards on it, set apart by an even
// 10 pt gap, 16 pt corners and a breath of shade instead of lines. No borders, no glass, no wallpaper. The
// type is a low-contrast ink (6.02:1 over the page, above the 4.5:1 floor) and the one saturated
// accent (#d0501f) marks focus, Send, links and the working dot. ANSI colors are solved in OKLCH
// at one lightness over the page (every hue at least 4.6:1). An opt-in look: nothing changes
// until you pick it.
{
  "name": "Plush Clay",
  "description": "Light: warm sand, raised panels, one bright accent.",
  "appearance.theme": "Builtin Light",
  "appearance.appTheme": "followTerminal",
